格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Plugins for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): database workbench, S3 storage, OpenTelemetry export and browser control — install one or all in a single package","id":"gh:1386559274","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-toolkit","slug":"Onenightcarnival/dsh-toolkit","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Plugins for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): database workbench, S3 storage, OpenTelemetry export and browser"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" control — install one or all in a single package"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-toolkit"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English** | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Plugins for DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`): databases, object storage, observability, browser control, AI "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"subscriptions and a configuration center. All packages share a version and release workflow."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"| Package | What it adds | Where it appears |"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| `@onenightcarnival/dsh-rdb` | Relational database workbench: SQLite / PostgreSQL / MySQL / GaussDB"},{"id":"p6s2","text":", data grid, structure, SQL editor, `db_*` tools | Sidebar \"Database\" |\n| `@onenightcarnival/dsh-s3`"},{"id":"p6s3","text":" | S3-compatible object storage browser: MinIO / OSS / COS / R2, `s3_*` tools | Sidebar \"S3\" |\n| `@o"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"nenightcarnival/dsh-otel` | OpenTelemetry GenAI export to Langfuse and other OTLP backends | Setting"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"s → Observability |\n| `@onenightcarnival/dsh-bridge-browser` | Browser bridge: `browser_*` tools dri"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"ving the user's tabs through the Chrome / Firefox extension | Settings → General → Browser bridge ad"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"dress |\n| `@onenightcarnival/dsh-subscriptions` | Codex, ChatGPT, Google Antigravity and Grok models"},{"id":"p6s8","text":", Codex search, Grok X search, image and video tools | Sidebar \"AI subscriptions\" |\n| `@onenightcarn"},{"id":"p6s9","text":"ival/dsh-config-center` | MCP and skill management, dedicated uv / Python environment, common settin"},{"id":"p6s10","text":"gs of built-in plugins | Sidebar → MCP / Skills; Settings → Environment dependencies / Plugins → Com"},{"id":"p6s11","text":"mon settings |\n| `@onenightcarnival/dsh-memory` | Layered career records, lessons, human corrections"},{"id":"p6s12","text":", version history and `memory_*` tools | Sidebar \"Memory\" |\n| `@onenightcarnival/dsh-gateway` | Loca"},{"id":"p6s13","text":"l API gateway: OpenAI Chat Completions / Responses and Anthropic Messages endpoints over the configu"},{"id":"p6s14","text":"red models, API keys, usage accounting | Sidebar \"API gateway\" |\n| `@onenightcarnival/dsh-toolkit` |"},{"id":"p6s15","text":" Integrated package with all eight plugins | Each module's entry point |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Runtime compatibility"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Toolkit version | dsh runtime |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| 0.9.0+ | `0.2.2-rc.1` (workspace pin) |\n| 0.8.2 | `0.2.1-rc.5` |\n| 0.8.1 | `0.2.1-rc.3` |\n| 0.8.0 "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"| `0.2.1-rc.2` |\n| 0.7.x | `0.2.0-rc.2` |\n| 0.6.x | `0.1.7-rc.2` |\n| 0.5.x | `0.1.5-rc.2` |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Plugins and hosts use the same runtime line. A mismatch causes typert validation failures and preven"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"sts use the same runtime line. A mismatch causes typert validation failures and prevents UI loading."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Every release carries:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| File | Purpose |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| `onenightcarnival-dsh-toolkit-<version>.tgz` | All eight plugins in one install |\n| `onenightcarni"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"val-dsh-rdb-<version>.tgz` and the other seven | One plugin on its own |\n| `dsh-browser-extension-ch"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"rome-<version>.zip` | Chrome extension, loaded unpacked |\n| `SHA256SUMS.txt` | Checksums |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Installation modes: the integrated toolkit or standalone plugins. The two modes are mutually exclusi"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"tallation modes: the integrated toolkit or standalone plugins. The two modes are mutually exclusive."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**Desktop app**: Plugins → Config center… → Plugins → Install from .tgz, pick the file, restart when"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"app**: Plugins → Config center… → Plugins → Install from .tgz, pick the file, restart when prompted."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**dsh CLI**:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**Chrome extension**: extract to a permanent directory → `chrome://extensions` → Developer mode → Lo"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ad unpacked. Local Chrome connections discover the bridge automatically and require no token entry. "},{"id":"p19s3","text":"Firefox requires a source build and token configuration; see browser control."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Module configuration"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Module keys, defaults and override examples: integrated package configuration."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Migrating from the standalone packages"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Packages use the `@onenightcarnival/` scope from 0.5.0. Migration order: remove the old `dsh-rdb`, `"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"dsh-s3` and `dsh-otel` packages → install their replacements. Connections, credentials and settings "},{"id":"p23s3","text":"remain under `~/.dsh`."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Layout"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| Path | Responsibility |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| `packages/{rdb,s3,otel,browser-bridge,subscriptions,config-center,memory,gateway}` | Eight standal"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"one plugins |\n| `packages/toolkit` | Module configuration, host and UI mounting, typert registration"},{"id":"p26s3","text":" |\n| `extensions/dsh-browser` | Chrome / Firefox MV3 extension |\n| `benchmark` | Playwright comparis"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"on benchmark |\n| `docs/browser.md` | Browser installation, capabilities, troubleshooting and securit"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"y boundaries |\n| `scripts/build-plugin.mjs` | Shared esbuild configuration for host and client bundl"},{"id":"p26s6","text":"es |\n| `scripts/version.mjs` | Package, extension manifest and OTel version synchronization |\n| `scr"},{"id":"p26s7","text":"ipts/package.mjs` | Release artifacts and checksums |\n| `scripts/check-runtime.mjs` | Runtime versio"},{"id":"p26s8","text":"n validation |\n| `scripts/smoke-runtime.mjs` | Real host validation in an isolated data directory |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Node.js `^22.19 || >=24`, pnpm 11. Every command runs at the repository root."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"### Build contract"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Item | Contract |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| Host dependencies | dsh provides `@deepseek-ai/*`; package build configurations select other depen"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"dencies for inlining |\n| Subscription authentication | `@cortexkit/antigravity-auth-core` is a runti"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"me dependency of subscriptions and toolkit |\n| Integrated package | Bundles the eight packages' sour"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"ces directly; typechecking covers the same sources |\n| Runtime versions | Pinned through `pnpm-works"},{"id":"p32s5","text":"pace.yaml` overrides |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"### Installation validation"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"1. Set `DSH_HOME` to a temporary directory and run `dsh plugin --profile web add file:<tgz>`.\n2. Sta"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"rt `dsh web --no-open --port 0` and exchange the ready log's token URL for a cookie. Each token perm"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"its one exchange.\n3. Use the cookie to check `/api/dsh-toolkit/modules`, `/api/dsh-rdb/profiles`, `/"},{"id":"p34s4","text":"api/dsh-s3/profiles`, `/api/dsh-config-center/mcp` and `/ext/bridge-config`."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Same-version `file:` packages install from the pnpm store cache; repeat validation requires `plugin "},{"id":"p35s2","text":"remove` before reinstallation."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## Release"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"The release version comes from the `v<version>` tag:"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"| Stage | Result |"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"| Install | Dependencies installed from the lockfile |\n| Version synchronization | `scripts/version."},{"id":"p40s2","text":"mjs set` writes the tag version into packages, extension manifests and OTel `PLUGIN_VERSION` |\n| Val"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"idation and build | Typecheck → build → test → package |\n| Release | All files in `dist/` attached t"},{"id":"p40s4","text":"o the matching GitHub Release |"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
